  "system": {
    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">Your will to survive pushes your body on, despite your injuries. If your hit points are reduced to 0 and you are not <em>wounded</em>, you can choose to not fall unconscious, and remain able to act. In this state, you still gain <em>dying</em> and can make the saving throws to recover every turn. Once you successfully recover hit points or are stabilized, you gain <em style=\"mso-bidi-font-style:normal\">wounded 1</em>.</span></p>"
